  "releaseNotes": "* Reliability: Serialized all database write paths, including direct, bulk, delete, schema, import, and maintenance operations.\n\t\t\t* Reliability: Added cooperative cancellation and transactional rollback for bulk writes and imports.\n\t\t\t* Reliability: Fixed schema event subscription leaks and stale LocaliteStore initialization state.\n\t\t\t* Build: Updated Source Link and pinned a patched .NET SDK.\n\t\t\t* Packaging: Added license and third-party notice files and validated the generated package with clean-consumer tests.\n\t\t\t* Documentation: Corrected cache examples and encryption-key guidance, with package quickstarts now covered by executable tests.\n\t\t\t* Licensing: Released Localite under the Apache License 2.0 and corrected third-party license metadata.",
